Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.00,H_en,,0,0,0,,"She's just a CROW with no divine fire" ... "Whether she's a phoenix is NONE of your business."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.00,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.50,S_en,,0,0,0,,Who allowed you to touch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.44,S_en,,0,0,0,,Feng Qiwu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:03.50,S_en,,0,0,0,,For an outsider,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:08.26,S_en,,0,0,0,,you raise your hand against the Golden Phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.74,S_en,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:11.14,S_en,,0,0,0,,Just a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:14.28,S_en,,0,0,0,,She is clearly just a crow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:16.08,S_en,,0,0,0,,with no phoenix blood, no divine fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,Even her aura differs from the phoenix clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:20.08,S_en,,0,0,0,,How long will you keep deceiving yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.02,S_en,,0,0,0,,Right, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.96,S_en,,0,0,0,,Hurry, persuade her!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.18,S_en,,0,0,0,,Everything depends on you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.58,S_en,,0,0,0,,Whether she's a phoenix
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:28.00,S_en,,0,0,0,,is none of your business.
